# Electroconvection benchmark at the published Luo et al. resolution.
# Reference: Luo, Wu, Yi & Tan, Phys. Rev. E 93, 023309 (2016).
#
# This 197 x 321 configuration is a GPU-scale benchmark and is not intended
# for CI. The preset supplies the validated MRT/direct-potential EHD scheme;
# the Domain and Run directives below override the modest preset defaults.

Preset electroconvection_2d
Domain L = 1.0 x 1.0  N = 197 x 321
Run 50000 steps
